face"><option>1-3 business days</option><option>3-5 business days</option></select></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-5 text-on-surface"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary"> Enable free shipping threshold</label></div></article><article id="payment-settings" class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Payment settings</h2><p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-secondary">Choose the payment methods offered at checkout and settlement currency.</p><div class="mt-4 space-y-3"><label class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><span>Cash on delivery</span><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary" checked></label><label class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><span>Card payments</span><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary"></label><label class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><span>Bank transfer</span><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary"></label><p class="text-xs text-secondary">Payment gateway credentials should be managed through protected server configuration.</p></div></article><article id="notification-settings" class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Notification settings</h2><p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-secondary">Select which operational events send notifications to administrators.</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary" checked><span>New orders</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary" checked><span>Low stock alerts</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary" checked><span>Payment failures</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary" checked><span>Delivery exceptions</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary" checked><span>Customer messages</span></label><label class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3 text-on-surface"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-primary" checked><span>Daily summary</span></label></div></article><article id="email-templates" class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Email templates</h2><p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-secondary">Review customer email content and sender identity.</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-label-sm text-secondary">Sender name<input class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2 text-on-surface" value="Luvora"></label><label class="text-label-sm text-secondary">Sender email<input type="email" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2 text-on-surface" value="orders@luvora.lk"></label><label class="text-label-sm text-secondary sm:col-span-2">Order confirmation template<textarea class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-3 py-2 text-on-surface" rows="3">Thank you for your order. We will send tracking details when it ships.</textarea></label><button type="button" class="w-fit rounded-full bg-surface-container px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-on-surface">Preview email template</button></div></article><article id="system-health" class="rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">System health</h2><p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-secondary">Operational status overview for core store services.</p><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3"><span class="text-on-surface">Admin portal</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Operational</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3"><span class="text-on-surface">Database</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Connected</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3"><span class="text-on-surface">Queue worker</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Monitor required</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3"><span class="text-on-surface">Email delivery</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Configuration required</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3"><span class="text-on-surface">Payment gateway</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">Configuration required</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low p-3"><span class="text-on-surface">Last checked</span><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">14 Oct 2026 15:06</span></div></div></article></section><div class="flex justify-end gap-3 pb-space-lg"><button type="button" class="rounded-full bg-surface-container px-5 py-2.5 font-semibold text-on-surface" onclick="window.location.reload()">Discard changes</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full bg-primary-container px-6 py-2.5 font-semibold text-on-primary-container" onclick="alert(&quot;Settings are a UI preview and are not saved yet.&quot;)">Save settings</button></div